(6531346, 971774, 124982, '<td valign="top">Like it, but the glasses spoil it for me...just dont fit in. The image would''ve been so much more powerful had you put the beads on the back of the eyelids as I''ve seen done before.</td>', 'Like it, but the glasses spoil it for me...just dont fit in. The image would''ve been so much more powerful had you put the beads on the back of the eyelids as I''ve seen done before.', '2011-09-07 09:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531374, 971935, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge. I think I would prefer a square crop with these type of images. However you got a lot of colors and they are very precisely arranged.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge. I think I would prefer a square crop with these type of images. However you got a lot of colors and they are very precisely arranged.', '2011-09-07 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531375, 971940, 10785, '<td valign="top">If I were you, since you don''t have the focus on the eyes, I would have left them out altogether and made the lips the only feature in the photo. They are in good focus but not quite sharp enough.</td>', 'If I were you, since you don''t have the focus on the eyes, I would have left them out altogether and made the lips the only feature in the photo. They are in good focus but not quite sharp enough.', '2011-09-07 09:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531377, 971815, 10785, '<td valign="top">The lips have great color and a lot of contrast. You sacrificed the details in the sugar cube a little though.</td>', 'The lips have great color and a lot of contrast. You sacrificed the details in the sugar cube a little though.', '2011-09-07 09:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531380, 971696, 10785, '<td valign="top">A very basic shot using natural light. There is a lot of grey in the tones without a lot of highlights and shadows which I think is somewhat of a minus. I like the texture of the background but the subject just doesn''t pop off the page.</td>', 'A very basic shot using natural light. There is a lot of grey in the tones without a lot of highlights and shadows which I think is somewhat of a minus. I like the texture of the background but the subject just doesn''t pop off the page.', '2011-09-07 09:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531382, 970950, 10785, '<td valign="top">You got good depth of field but I don''t find anything of interest in this macro. Nothing stands out as the subject.</td>', 'You got good depth of field but I don''t find anything of interest in this macro. Nothing stands out as the subject.', '2011-09-07 09:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531383, 971366, 10785, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of the hand in sharp focus. I think you needed a smaller aperture.</td>', 'I would like to see more of the hand in sharp focus. I think you needed a smaller aperture.', '2011-09-07 09:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531390, 971770, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I would love to wait around to see how long it takes all that stuff to come together and form life. As far as the photo goes, I think you have a little too much at the top and it''s not really centered in the frame. The straws may not have been needed but that is subjective. It is fairly grey and not real sharp so it needs more light.</td>', 'Good concept. I would love to wait around to see how long it takes all that stuff to come together and form life. As far as the photo goes, I think you have a little too much at the top and it''s not really centered in the frame. The straws may not have been needed but that is subjective. It is fairly grey and not real sharp so it needs more light.', '2011-09-07 09:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531394, 971774, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the props. I think the skin is a little surreal for me. Too much gaussian blur hid all the texture.</td>', 'Nice job on the props. I think the skin is a little surreal for me. Too much gaussian blur hid all the texture.', '2011-09-07 09:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531400, 971874, 10785, '<td valign="top">The granular part is good. Great stopped motion, great pose and it is nicely lit. The woman is very pretty but there are a few things I find distracting. The double eyebrow and what I perceive as the shadow on the chin from the lip ring?? I don''t know what that adds to the portrait.</td>', 'The granular part is good. Great stopped motion, great pose and it is nicely lit. The woman is very pretty but there are a few things I find distracting. The double eyebrow and what I perceive as the shadow on the chin from the lip ring?? I don''t know what that adds to the portrait.', '2011-09-07 09:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531402, 971674, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Bad choice in title! I didn''t really mark it down because of that though.</td>', 'Great photo. Bad choice in title! I didn''t really mark it down because of that though.', '2011-09-07 09:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6531442, 971934, 129607, '<td valign="top">If this was brightened a bit, it would be stellar. Nice concept!</td>', 'If this was brightened a bit, it would be stellar. Nice concept!', '2011-09-07 10:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
