(6535877, 971879, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and processing. The soft focus works well to give it a sense of depth.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and processing. The soft focus works well to give it a sense of depth.', '2011-09-10 19:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535879, 971883, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the green color cast in this image and how it contrasts with the sprinkles. It works well.</td>', 'I like the green color cast in this image and how it contrasts with the sprinkles. It works well.', '2011-09-10 19:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535883, 971672, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like this because it''s in focus. For some reason I am rating the still grains higher than the blurry ones. I also like the border on this.</td>', 'I like this because it''s in focus. For some reason I am rating the still grains higher than the blurry ones. I also like the border on this.', '2011-09-10 19:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535885, 971926, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and perspective. There is something going on in that wheel that I like, I don''t know if it''s the sharpening or if it''s tone-mapped or what, but I like it.</td>', 'I like the colors and perspective. There is something going on in that wheel that I like, I don''t know if it''s the sharpening or if it''s tone-mapped or what, but I like it.', '2011-09-10 19:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535886, 971842, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF. I like the colors and reflection. I could consider a tighter crop to clean up some of the negative space on the bottom, but I do like this image.</td>', 'Very nice DOF. I like the colors and reflection. I could consider a tighter crop to clean up some of the negative space on the bottom, but I do like this image.', '2011-09-10 19:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535887, 971280, 125275, '<td valign="top">Bonus point for making me want one!</td>', 'Bonus point for making me want one!', '2011-09-10 19:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535888, 971262, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and DOF. Works well with the subject.</td>', 'Nice contrast and DOF. Works well with the subject.', '2011-09-10 19:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535889, 971666, 125275, '<td valign="top">I love how the grains seem frozen. Don''t even need the egg, but it works well.</td>', 'I love how the grains seem frozen. Don''t even need the egg, but it works well.', '2011-09-10 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535891, 971575, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach. I like it. The focus seems a bit soft. Perhaps some sharpening could bring out some of the detail in the fully ground pile. Nice concept.</td>', 'Interesting approach. I like it. The focus seems a bit soft. Perhaps some sharpening could bring out some of the detail in the fully ground pile. Nice concept.', '2011-09-10 19:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535892, 971852, 125275, '<td valign="top">Haha, nice.</td>', 'Haha, nice.', '2011-09-10 19:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535894, 971298, 125275, '<td valign="top">I am starting to think we might see another strawberry on the front page. (See the most recent stopped motion and recipe challenges.) This looks tasty!</td>', 'I am starting to think we might see another strawberry on the front page. (See the most recent stopped motion and recipe challenges.) This looks tasty!', '2011-09-10 19:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535895, 971774, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the strong noise reduction on the skin. It almost makes her look like a machine. A sprinkles machine.</td>', 'I like the strong noise reduction on the skin. It almost makes her look like a machine. A sprinkles machine.', '2011-09-10 19:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535896, 971639, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very clean. <br/> <br/>Hey I can see you in the reflection! It looks like you are bouncing off the ceiling like I do. Nice.</td>', 'Very clean.  Hey I can see you in the reflection! It looks like you are bouncing off the ceiling like I do. Nice.', '2011-09-10 19:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535899, 971746, 125275, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and rich tones. I like my coffee black, but I''d probably just shove the spoonful of sugar in my mouth.</td>', 'Love the perspective and rich tones. I like my coffee black, but I''d probably just shove the spoonful of sugar in my mouth.', '2011-09-10 19:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535902, 970953, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice viewpoint and processing, and I like the off white border.</td>', 'Nice viewpoint and processing, and I like the off white border.', '2011-09-10 19:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535903, 971799, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice and rich tones. Very clear and well lit and interesting composition. Looks very professional.</td>', 'Nice and rich tones. Very clear and well lit and interesting composition. Looks very professional.', '2011-09-10 19:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535904, 971722, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like this lighting and browns. I hope this wasn''t too much of a mess to clean up!</td>', 'I like this lighting and browns. I hope this wasn''t too much of a mess to clean up!', '2011-09-10 19:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
