(6536511, 971751, 128201, '<td valign="top">-removed broken post-<br/> <br/>Somehow I keep posting single characters, or url addresses as comments. Sorry for the confusion.<br/> <br/>Anyway, this is an interesting take on granular. I like the dust and gritty feel to it. It works well as black and white. But I feel like it needs more of a story behind it to really grab my attention.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-09-16 01:10:46.</i></td>', '-removed broken post- Somehow I keep posting single characters, or url addresses as comments. Sorry for the confusion. Anyway, this is an interesting take on granular. I like the dust and gritty feel to it. It works well as black and white. But I feel like it needs more of a story behind it to really grab my attention.', '2011-09-11 18:22:42.000000', '2011-09-16 02:10:46.000000', 1),
