(6538928, 971639, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, and I like the originality of using the shaker caps. BTW, for yin and yang, the pepper cap should be in the salt, and vice versa. (No points off for that.)</td>', 'Beautifully done, and I like the originality of using the shaker caps. BTW, for yin and yang, the pepper cap should be in the salt, and vice versa. (No points off for that.)', '2011-09-13 21:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
