(6538933, 971696, 76335, '<td valign="top">Points for the profund simplicity of this. The soft contrast, natural light (?), and smart point of view all say sugar (or sugah) without any gratuitous distractions. Sweet.</td>', 'Points for the profund simplicity of this. The soft contrast, natural light (?), and smart point of view all say sugar (or sugah) without any gratuitous distractions. Sweet.', '2011-09-13 21:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
