(6539768, 971639, 44877, '<td valign="top">You did a great job - I tried the same thing with pink and white salt and soon gave up. So kudos for your tenacity to get this so perfect. Wonderful shot!</td>', 'You did a great job - I tried the same thing with pink and white salt and soon gave up. So kudos for your tenacity to get this so perfect. Wonderful shot!', '2011-09-14 13:24:32.000000', NULL, 0),
