(6539778, 971588, 100831, '<td valign="top">But we don''t really know what it is... that''s half the beauty. <br/>Excellent abstract... congrats on the blue bling!</td>', 'But we don''t really know what it is... that''s half the beauty. Excellent abstract... congrats on the blue bling!', '2011-09-14 13:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6539801, 971807, 66398, '<td valign="top">Very cool Maggie. The Posthumous is well deserved. I''m actually surprised at the lack of comments about you know what... lol Except tnun hinted that direction. You should always trust your gut and this is proof. Great job!!</td>', 'Very cool Maggie. The Posthumous is well deserved. I''m actually surprised at the lack of comments about you know what... lol Except tnun hinted that direction. You should always trust your gut and this is proof. Great job!!', '2011-09-14 14:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
