(6539893, 970919, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kwakerr:</b></div><hr/><i> why is the composition this way? why not have equal space on the three sides of the glass? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Equal space almost always causes a composition to be too stable and become dull to look at. This composition is perfect.</td>', 'Originally posted by kwakerr: why is the composition this way? why not have equal space on the three sides of the glass?   Equal space almost always causes a composition to be too stable and become dull to look at. This composition is perfect.', '2011-09-14 15:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6539910, 971588, 104230, '<td valign="top">Fascinating and lovely.  I''ve always enjoyed how just by rotating an image (other processes too, I imagine) indentations in the sand can appear to be raised surfaces, as in this foot. I suppose it''s to do with how our brains are wired/conditioned to interpret the light patterns..</td>', 'Fascinating and lovely.  I''ve always enjoyed how just by rotating an image (other processes too, I imagine) indentations in the sand can appear to be raised surfaces, as in this foot. I suppose it''s to do with how our brains are wired/conditioned to interpret the light patterns..', '2011-09-14 16:06:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6539914, 971848, 63806, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a top finish! This was beautifully done..</td>', 'Congrats on a top finish! This was beautifully done..', '2011-09-14 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6539915, 971883, 131871, '<td valign="top">Thank you all! :) This is the highest I have gotten here at DP Challenge! I appreciate all the comments and critiques. Thank you again!</td>', 'Thank you all! :) This is the highest I have gotten here at DP Challenge! I appreciate all the comments and critiques. Thank you again!', '2011-09-14 16:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6540027, 971619, 62667, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your kind comments.  Thought it might have performed a bit better.  I understand it is not eye-popping but I thought the concept and execution was not half bad. It''s my first and I will keep plugging away.</td>', 'Thank you all for your kind comments.  Thought it might have performed a bit better.  I understand it is not eye-popping but I thought the concept and execution was not half bad. It''s my first and I will keep plugging away.', '2011-09-14 18:34:07.000000', NULL, 0),
